  "description": "Hindley–Milner type resolution for the Flow language (named for Robin Milner):\nunification over declared command arrow signatures, port types, services, and literals, checking\nevery v3 `.tk` body at generation time so type errors surface as Flow diagnostics instead of C#\ncompile errors in the generated code (or runtime casts). Lenient by design where Flow is dynamic:\n`Object` is the dynamic type and unifies both ways; unknown constructs infer fresh variables.",
